# Runtime pieces of the LuxenOS system-management and desktop apps (Update
# Manager, Hardware Manager, Software Center, notifications, plugins). All of
# them are small and in both Debian 13 (trixie) and Debian 14 (forky).
#
# Hardware Manager: lspci / lsusb, Secure Boot state (mokutil).
pciutils
usbutils
mokutil
# Software Center: AppStream (DEP-11) metadata from the Debian archive (apt
# downloads it with the package lists) and its GObject bindings.
appstream
gir1.2-appstream-1.0
# Notification Center: the freedesktop "message" sound, played with pw-play.
sound-theme-freedesktop
# Plugin sandbox (also a dependency of flatpak, listed because LuxenOS uses it
# directly).
bubblewrap
